      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.68,
      "end_seconds": 153.01,
      "duration_seconds": 13.33,
      "text": "I skip breakfast most days. I work in an office, mostly sitting at a desk. Not really, I don't get much exercise"
