      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.62,
      "end_seconds": 306.98,
      "duration_seconds": 10.36,
      "text": "let me tell you where I've got to. It points towards low sugar episodes related to diabetes medication. I'd also keep a meal-timing issue in mind"
