      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.97,
      "end_seconds": 332.04,
      "duration_seconds": 18.07,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with low sugar episodes related to diabetes medication do well once it's treated properly. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had shaky spells, since yesterday, severe, and no confusion or weight loss."
    },
