      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.07,
      "end_seconds": 361.06,
      "duration_seconds": 26.99,
      "text": "I'm sending you for a blood sugar test cos of hypoglycaemia always keep glucose tablets or a sweet in your bag and don't skip meals if you've taken your sugar tablet and please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit so we can settle the dose i'd like to see you again in two weeks take care and call us if anything changes"
